  "methods": "<p>This dataset contains preprocessed records for 1) electrophysiology recordings with\u00a0membrane voltage or EMG current, stimulus parameters, exposure times from synchronous video recordings, as well as the position of a force probe calculated\u00a0from simultaneous videos, 2) limb positions tracked from video recordings during optogenetic perturbation, and 3) recordings of the position and velocity of a ball during optogenetic perturbation in flies walking on the ball.</p>\r\n",
